From 5e4867da6f4c4a62eb1a1d63c9228d16b2372e57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ProtoGrid <protogrid@localhost>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:20:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] finalmask: add Xray-compatible UDP noise mask

Noise emits decoy datagrams before the first packet to a destination and follows Xray's reset/rand/type semantics so the same finalmask settings work with both cores.
